# Internal docs — only README.md and README-v1-archive.md are public.
# Blanket-ignores .md files at any depth rather than listing internal
# filenames individually, so new internal docs are excluded by default.
# Any new public .md needs an explicit exception below.
*.md
!README.md
!README-v1-archive.md
ideas/
__pycache__/

# Reports — keep folder tracked but exclude generated reports
reports/*.md
!reports/.gitkeep
